# (counted twice, the count stays on the same side of 0 and of 10 there) and DIFFERENT on at least one of pairs 5 to 9,
# whose count crosses AMD's bound of 10 when it is counted twice (where optical flow's colour and the game's agree, as on
# a picture that only slides, the bound changes nothing and the control says so).
what THE CONTROL OF fi-store-apart's AGAIN: the glue counts every dispatch of a pair, as AMD's dispatch does
passes none
